	<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[顺通道继续往里探看 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">冷水灌入袖口令人打颤。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[顺通道继续往里探看 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Moment Foghorn 3 [nobr]
